IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ehm, potresti aiutarmi col mio
esperimento, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ah, niente di troppo stravagante!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non si tratta di un incrocio tra
{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}} e {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Vorrei solo che tu sotterrassi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}capsula del tempo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Dentro c'è una cosa.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} che non
voglio vedere per un po'.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Potresti sotterrare questa capsula
per me, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Ci penso io!
Non posso.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bir deneyde bana yardım eder
misin diye düşünüyordum, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Merak
etme, öyle tuhaf bir şey değil! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ben {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}} ile
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}} çaprazlamıyorum falan.
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Senden sadece şu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}kapsülü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
gömmeni istiyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
İçine, bir süre yer altında
tutmak istediğim bir şey koydum{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Kapsülü benim için gömer
misin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Elbette!
Şey... hayır.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I've had the most interesting idea,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}There's something
I own.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}and I want it buried for a while.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It won't get dirty. I've put it
inside a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}capsule{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Would you mind burying it for me?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
And then, sometime in the future,
I'll ask you to dig it back up.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Sure, I'll help!
Hmm. No way.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}He tenido una idea muy interesante,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Se trata de un objeto
de mi propiedad.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Quiero enterrarlo por un tiempo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Lo he puesto dentro de una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}cápsula
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}para que no se ensucie.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Mis manos son demasiado delicadas
para este tipo de trabajo tan sucio.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿La entierras tú por mí, clavelín?
En el futuro te pediré que me
la traigas de vuelta, claro.{{TAG:000F:0005:00002800}}
Te ayudaré
Ni hablar

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ho avuto un'idea brillante,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}C'è una delle mie cose.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}che voglio sotterrare per un po'.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ma no, non si sporcherà! L'ho messa
in una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}capsula del tempo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}. {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Potresti
sotterrarla per me?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Poi, più avanti, ti chiederò
di dissotterrarla.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Ti aiuto io!
Non me la sento.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Aklıma çok ilginç bir fikir
geldi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Sahip olduğum
bir şey var{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}ve bir süre gömülü kalsın
istiyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kirlenmez; onu bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}kapsülün{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
içine koydum.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Benim için gömer misin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sonra gelecekte bir gün senden
çıkarıp getirmeni isterim.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Tabii, yardım ederim!
Hmm... olmaz.

DE:
Du willst mir nicht helfen? {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Schade.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich kann es dir aber nicht verdenken.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Es ist schon eine seltsame Bitte!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Entiérrala donde quieras.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ahora
la tienes en el bolsillo de las cartas.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¡Ni se te ocurra mirar dentro!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Entiérrala y ya está, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Remember that capsule I gave you?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
The one I wanted you to bury?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}You didn't do it yet, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}so I think I'm
reconsidering.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Yes, for sure.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sorry, but I'd like it back.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ti ricordi la capsula che ti ho dato?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Quella che ti avevo chiesto
di sotterrare?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Visto che non l'hai ancora fatto,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ci sto ripensando.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sì, ho deciso.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Scusa, ma la rivorrei indietro.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Pero si la has abierto!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Te dejé muy claro que
no lo hicieras!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Cosa? Hai aperto la capsula?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ci mancava pure questa.
Grazie tante!

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Magari ci riproviamo un'altra volta.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Se mai ci sarà un'altra volta,
non aspettare così tanto!

TRANSLATION:
